{"about_the_game":"Welcome, Horror Tube Influencer in a world where you try to gain your way to fame in a horror survival-type investigation world. Travel to different haunted locations by yourself or collaborate with up to four other scared tubers as you search for ghosts. Use items to determine what type of ghost you are dealing with, and always remember these ghosts are not friendly. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nScared Tube uses your trusty cell phone and other gear, a checklist, and a camera. Design your character because who doesn\u2019t like custom characters? But don't forget to buy some gear from the store, especially caffeine pills, because the witching hours when ghost are most active requires players to stay wide awake or die in a trance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\tThe game uses different types of environments and more to come<br />\r\n\u2022\tAll gear is needed because you will never know what kind of ghost you are dealing with. <br />\r\n\u2022\tEach ghost type uses a different hunting pattern, so be worn, or maybe lose control and watch as you attack your friends. <br />\r\n\u2022\tLike any Influencer, your subscribers dictate your earning power, and if you die, you lose with a self-correcting system. <br />\r\n\u2022\tAlso, Influencers, you are responsible for your own gear because who gets free gear without sponsorship","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ghost Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2007700/e1ed9e8c995d66ddef795790fd58df1e97fb9077.jpg"},{"name":"Death Is Not The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2007700/e273f5c7f849889fe662cfcf5269b7ff10763016.jpg"},{"name":"Holy Preacher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2007700/48114e98f8ab3139765429aa7340799c709a6caa.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost Whisperer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2007700/4a50b774138621315d1e1e791e367707e97